# The Vercel env manifest is generated but MUST be tracked: it is the declarative
# record both projects' environments are reconciled against, and
# _shared/tests/env-manifest.test.mjs reads it. It carries no secret values -
# generate-env-manifest.mjs aborts if one would be written, and redacts the token
# segment of vercel_blob_rw_* variable names.
!config/vercel-env.manifest.json
